{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World's First Card + Backpack System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards + Backpack Management, Pre-battle + Mid-battle = Dual Strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Micro-control + Auto Combat: Enjoy explosive battles without operational burden! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Strategic Real-time Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.poster.avif?t=1760023490\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.webm?t=1760023490\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475770/extras/2ec14cd1ae68537f5a642d21f0b5172e.mp4?t=1760023490\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Artifact Backpack &amp; Bond System enhance pre-battle depth!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse card mechanics + unique character energy systems secure mid-battle tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullet Time ensures decision space \u2013 no frantic button-mashing. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. 1+1&gt;2 Dual-Character System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True dual characters: Independent hands, simultaneous dual-line operation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergy-triggered Emergence enables 1+1&gt;2 combos:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gale Slash + Black Hole = Tornado</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice Arrow + Tornado = Blizzard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse